  "title": "Baka to Test to Shoukanjuu Ni!",
  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 132961 and TMDB show 56343. AniDB S1-S6 (\"Omake 1\" to \"Omake 6\") are TVDB S0E15 \"Spinout! Sore ga Bokura no Nichijou 1\" to TVDB S0E20 \"Spinout! Sore ga Bokura no Nichijou 6\" and TMDB S0E11 \"バカとテストと召喚獣 SPINOUT！それが僕らの日常。遠征中 1\" (Baka \u0026 Test: Spinout! Part 1) to TMDB S0E16 \"バカとテストと召喚獣 SPINOUT！それが僕らの日常。遠征中 6\" (Baka \u0026 Test: Spinout! Part 6); AniDB S7 \"BD special ep 1 ED\" has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E7 is \"Specials 6 - Baka Tales\", another item) and no TMDB episode (its default TMDB S0E7 is \"Special Christmas Footage\", another item); AniDB S8 \"魔法秀吉ひでよし\" (Hideyoshi Hideyoshi Magic) is TVDB S0E23 \"Hideyoshi Hideyoshi Magic\" and TMDB S0E10 \"『魔法秀吉ひでよし』\" (Hideyoshi Magic Hideyoshi); AniDB S9 \"魔法秀吉ひでよし 予告編\" (Hideyoshi Hideyoshi Magic Trailer) has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E9 is \"Matsuri 2 - Idiots, Fireworks and the Summoner Tournament\", another item); AniDB S10-S15 (\"映像特典#1 「視聴覚室の中心でBAKAと叫ぶ」\" (Shout BAKA in the Middle of the Audiovisual Room 1) to \"映像特典#6 「視聴覚室の中心でBAKAと叫ぶ」\" (Shout BAKA in the Middle of the Audiovisual Room 6)) have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items) and no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items); AniDB S16 \"魔法秀吉ひでよし 特報\" (Hideyoshi Hideyoshi Magic News Flash) is TMDB S0E8 \"『魔法秀吉ひでよし』特報\" (Hideyoshi Magic Hideyoshi - Special News) and has no TVDB episode (its default TVDB S0E16 is \"Spinout! Sore ga Bokura no Nichijou 2\", another item); AniDB S17 \"新作アニメーション\" (Episode S17) is TVDB S0E24 \"Baka to Test Mini Special\" and TMDB S0E26 \"バカとテストと召喚獣 Blu-ray BOX 特典映像\" (Baka and Test Mini Special).",
